/*.suo

# Visual Studio local state: per-machine IIS Express config, caches and user
# settings. VS regenerates it on open, so it should not be committed. This
# supersedes the two .vs/**/.suo entries that used to be listed here.
.vs/

# Multiplayer worker: dependencies and wrangler's local build/state cache.
server/node_modules/

# Unanchored, because wrangler writes this wherever it is invoked from rather
# than only beside its config. The cache holds the Cloudflare account id and
# account name, which have no business in a public repository.
.wrangler/
